# 1. Phase Overview

**Phase Name:** Contractor Discounts and Commission Management  
**Project:** DECK PRO – Deck Restoration Estimator  
**Phase Number:** 09  
**Status:** Development Specification  
**Depends On:** Phases 3, 5, 6 and 8

## 1.1 Objective

Implement an Admin-controlled system that allows DECK PRO to manage contractor discounts and commission incentives.

The system must support:

1. Configurable contractor discount policies.
2. Percentage-based and fixed-amount discounts.
3. Contractor eligibility rules.
4. Discount limits and effective dates.
5. Discount application during estimate calculation.
6. Transparent discount breakdowns.
7. Lead conversion verification.
8. Commission calculation and approval.
9. Contractor commission history.
10. Admin commission management and reporting.
11. Complete audit history.

The implementation must integrate with the existing estimate engine and lead-management system.

## 1.2 Business Objective

DECK PRO has two important contractor-related financial workflows.

**Workflow A – Contractor Discount**

An eligible contractor receives a discount on an estimate according to an Admin-approved policy.

**Workflow B – Contractor Commission**

A contractor may earn a commission or referral incentive when an eligible lead results in a verified business conversion.

These workflows must remain separate.

A contractor discount reduces an applicable estimate amount. A commission represents an incentive earned under an approved business policy.

One must not automatically create or modify the other.

