# 13. Security Requirements

Implement:

- Role-based access control.
- Contractor ownership isolation.
- Estimate ownership checks.
- Lead-to-contractor authorization checks.
- Admin-only financial configuration.
- Server-side financial calculations.
- Mass-assignment protection.
- Input validation.
- Rate limiting on sensitive endpoints where appropriate.
- Audit logging.
- Secure error responses.
- Protection against duplicate requests.
- Protection against unauthorized status transitions.

Never trust:

- Contractor ID submitted by the frontend.
- Discount amount submitted by the frontend.
- Commission amount submitted by the frontend.
- Lead conversion status without verification.
- Estimate totals submitted by the frontend.
- Payment status submitted by the contractor.

Derive identity and authorization from the authenticated session and trusted database records.

