- Avoid repeated queries when calculating policy eligibility.
- Use atomic updates or transactions for financial operations.
- Preserve historical snapshots.
- Ensure failed financial operations do not leave partially updated records.

Do not introduce Redis, message queues, microservices, or external payment infrastructure unless a demonstrated requirement exists.

