# 16. Out of Scope

The following are not included in Phase 9 unless explicitly approved:

- Payment gateway integration.
- Automatic bank transfers.
- Contractor wallet.
- Automated tax filing.
- Automated invoice generation.
- Complex multi-level referral trees.
- Multi-tier commission hierarchies.
- AI-based contractor ranking.
- Automatic lead assignment changes.
- Changes to Phase 7 AI analysis.
- Rebuilding the Phase 6 pricing engine.
- Phase 10 platform-wide administration and reporting expansion.

Commission payment recording is included; automatic money transfer is not.

